{"sections":[{"slug":"椭圆曲线","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"椭圆曲线"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“椭圆曲线”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span></strong> (elliptic curve) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/亏格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">且有有理点</span> $e\\in X(k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般的整系数椭圆曲线形如</span>\n$$\r\nE \\colon y^2 + a_1 xy + a_3 y = x^3 + a_2 x^2 + a_4 x + a_6.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">在坐标变换</span> $y=\\frac{1}{2}(Y-a_1X-a_3)$, $x=X$ <span lang=\"zh\">之下</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">上式变为</span>\n$$\r\nY^2 = 4X^3 + b_2 X^2 + 2 b_4 X + b_6.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">任何椭圆曲线都可以写成</span>\n$$\r\nX = \\{ y^2 = x^3 + ax + b \\} \\cup \\{\\infty\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">复数上的椭圆曲线</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复数上的椭圆曲线可等价地定义为</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{C} / \\Lambda$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\Lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">为格点</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一维紧复</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie群","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">带有一个基点</span>;</li>\n<li>$3$ <span lang=\"zh\">次代数曲线</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $P,Q$ <span lang=\"zh\">是椭圆曲线上两点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $P,Q$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/除子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $P-Q=\\operatorname{div}(f)$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $P=Q$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">为常数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/谷山–志村猜想","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谷山</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">志村猜想</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}